  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"><br></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/bh13qlac2wzhftq/sC6L3HF.png?dl=1\" width=\"1708\" height=\"14\"></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Epic Paladins</strong> 引入了強大的終局盔甲套裝，提供極致的防護與獨特能力。透過收集稀有材料，例如地獄之星和其他珍貴資源，玩家可以使用鍛造台升級他們的盔甲。每次升級都會提升耐久度、抗性與特殊效果，讓這些盔甲成為應對最艱難戰鬥的必備裝備。只有最熟練的冒險者才能收集到必要的材料並打造出終極的聖騎士裝備。你準備好迎接挑戰，成為真正的傳奇了嗎？</span></p><h1><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>📦 安裝方式</strong></span></h1><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\">必要模組</span></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></li>\n</ul><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\">強烈推薦</span></h3><ul>\n<li>使用 JEI 或 REI 查看合成表！</li>\n<li>使用&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n<li>使用 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-roll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combat Roll</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🎨 特別感謝</strong></span></p><p><strong><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft-garage.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft-garage.com/</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;提供盔甲物品紋理與工具/武器物品紋理</em></strong></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><em><strong>加入我們的社群 Discord！</strong></em> <strong>前往看看</strong> <em><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4A9SEahH4U\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PixelDreamStudios</a> -</strong></em> <strong>官方合作夥伴！</strong></p><p><em><strong>加入我個人的 Discord - <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Eeqm5NMDK3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此處</a></strong></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fPixelDream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/PixelDreamStudios/SPEC_PixelDreamStudios_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></em></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/bh13qlac2wzhftq/sC6L3HF.png?dl=1\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🎥</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">展示影片</span>：</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S2rQoPBBBjI?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZMPoDHdDV2Q?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KzudL_1puFI?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z9hhoB2TukU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/bh13qlac2wzhftq/sC6L3HF.png?dl=1\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">📚圖片</span>：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/719/angel_and_armor-2.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/473/armor.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
